# This file keeps the security/sbom/ directory present in the repository so the
# scripts can write to it reproducibly. The actual SBOM JSON files emitted by
# scripts/sbom and the .github/workflows/sbom.yml job are gitignored via the
# standard re-include pattern in .gitignore (/security/sbom/* + !.gitkeep)
# because they change every build and are emitted as GitHub workflow artifacts
# named sbom-{ecosystem} instead.
#
# For the SBOM consumer guide, see security/SBOM.md at the repo root.
